WEBVTT

01:28.345 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL
"MY QUEEN" BY XIE LOUNAN

01:43.465 --> 01:44.625
Miss Ling.

01:45.825 --> 01:47.105
Greetings, Miss Ling.

01:47.185 --> 01:48.665
I've gathered all members of
Fenglai Pavilion from every region.

01:48.745 --> 01:49.585
They've been slipping
into the Capital in secret

01:49.665 --> 01:50.505
and are now standing by.

01:50.585 --> 01:51.985
Very well. Follow the plan.

01:52.065 --> 01:53.665
Take your men to the Prince of
Yuzhang's Manor and assist Zhong Lin.

01:53.745 --> 01:55.785
The rest is to stay put for now.

01:55.865 --> 01:56.945
Yes.

01:57.025 --> 01:58.505
What about you, Miss Ling?

01:59.585 --> 02:00.625
Phoenix Terrace.

02:37.105 --> 02:39.265
Minister Lin, you're back.

02:39.865 --> 02:40.945
Your Majesty,

02:41.465 --> 02:42.545
I have returned

02:43.225 --> 02:44.505
alive.

02:45.985 --> 02:48.665
You've served two reigns
and are revered by all.

02:49.665 --> 02:51.025
Yet due to the Ling faction's framing,

02:51.105 --> 02:52.025
you rose and fell three times

02:52.625 --> 02:54.585
and were only reinstated today.

02:55.105 --> 02:55.945
You've suffered a lot.

02:56.025 --> 02:58.865
I was stubborn and rigid.

02:59.585 --> 03:02.105
Your Majesty's decision to exile me

03:02.185 --> 03:04.345
was to protect me.

03:05.105 --> 03:07.065
I understand.

03:08.545 --> 03:10.505
Minister Lin, you're an upright man.

03:10.585 --> 03:13.545
The future of Great Qi will depend on you.

03:17.345 --> 03:18.585
Greetings, Your Majesty.

03:21.585 --> 03:22.665
Mr. Li.

03:23.625 --> 03:24.825
I hope you will continue

03:25.345 --> 03:27.665
to select worthy talents for Great Qi

03:27.745 --> 03:29.585
and demand justice for the people.

03:29.665 --> 03:32.625
Also, the status verification
system must be abolished.

03:32.705 --> 03:35.545
Only then can
Great Qi remain stable for long.

03:35.625 --> 03:38.265
Your Majesty, if you face any difficulty,

03:38.345 --> 03:40.385
you must tell us.

03:40.465 --> 03:43.025
Even if it costs my life,

03:43.625 --> 03:46.425
I will protect you.

03:48.105 --> 03:49.825
I appreciate it, Mr. Li.

03:49.905 --> 03:51.305
I would give

03:51.825 --> 03:54.385
everything for Great Qi,

03:54.465 --> 03:56.065
even if at the cost of my life.

04:30.625 --> 04:33.465
Since birth,
I have suffered from cold sickness.

04:34.585 --> 04:36.225
It's only with everyone's care

04:36.305 --> 04:37.425
that I have lived to see this day.

04:38.105 --> 04:40.465
I thank you all.

04:41.505 --> 04:43.865
Thank you for never abandoning me

04:43.945 --> 04:46.025
so that we could build
this flourishing age together.

04:46.785 --> 04:48.025
Today,

04:49.105 --> 04:50.665
I'd like to look upon

04:51.785 --> 04:53.105
my capital,

04:53.625 --> 04:55.025
my officials and people,

04:55.545 --> 04:56.785
and my land.

05:01.865 --> 05:04.105
Long live the wise ruler!

05:48.145 --> 05:49.625
Golden Phoenix Bids Farewell.

05:50.745 --> 05:51.825
Cangcang,

05:53.505 --> 05:54.945
when you see these fireworks,

05:56.105 --> 05:56.945
leave this place.

05:57.025 --> 05:58.025
Don't come back.

05:58.545 --> 06:00.345
This place is dangerous.

06:02.385 --> 06:03.825
If I survive this,

06:05.305 --> 06:06.905
I will never let you leave me again.

06:14.105 --> 06:15.305
Could it be…?

06:17.105 --> 06:18.305
Xiao Huan!

06:47.025 --> 06:48.065
Your Majesty,

06:49.025 --> 06:50.945
you said you wished to die with dignity.

06:54.025 --> 06:55.265
Do it now.

07:26.545 --> 07:29.865
Is this the ending you all wanted?

07:47.945 --> 07:49.945
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

07:51.505 --> 07:54.025
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

07:54.105 --> 07:56.225
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

07:59.985 --> 08:01.305
Xiao Huan!

08:06.265 --> 08:12.145
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

08:44.625 --> 08:45.825
No!

08:47.585 --> 08:48.425
Cangcang.

08:49.785 --> 08:51.425
Zhong Lin. Where's Xiao Huan?

08:52.225 --> 08:53.625
His Majesty jumped from Phoenix Terrace.

08:53.705 --> 08:55.025
The river was fast.

08:55.105 --> 08:56.865
Shi Yan and I have searched for him.

08:56.945 --> 08:58.785
Xiao Qianqing's men are
also looking along the banks,

08:58.865 --> 09:00.305
but haven't found him.

09:04.745 --> 09:06.265
Cangcang. Where are you going, Cangcang?

09:06.345 --> 09:07.185
I'm going to find him.

09:07.265 --> 09:09.185
Du Tingxin has
soldiers all over Phoenix Terrace.

09:09.265 --> 09:11.305
If you go now,
you're walking to your death.

09:26.225 --> 09:27.145
Saintess.

09:27.225 --> 09:28.425
Speak.

09:28.505 --> 09:30.345
The Emperor of Great Qi
jumped from Phoenix Terrace.

09:42.345 --> 09:43.385
Is he dead?

09:43.985 --> 09:45.145
They haven't found his body.

09:45.225 --> 09:48.305
But no one has ever
survived the Qining River.

09:54.265 --> 09:55.945
He does have some backbone

09:56.745 --> 09:59.585
to choose such a decisive way to die.

10:00.505 --> 10:02.505
I didn't get to meet him once.

10:03.425 --> 10:04.585
Now that I think of it,

10:05.665 --> 10:07.545
that's a shame.

10:08.425 --> 10:11.505
WUYING HALL

10:14.305 --> 10:15.465
Well?

10:15.545 --> 10:18.585
Do you like the gift I gave you, Qianqing?

10:18.665 --> 10:19.985
No.

10:20.585 --> 10:22.145
When I wanted it, you didn't give it.

10:22.225 --> 10:23.785
It means nothing when it comes late.

10:24.545 --> 10:25.945
It's like sincerity.

10:26.505 --> 10:27.505
If no one answers it,

10:28.585 --> 10:29.905
then the answer no longer matters.

10:31.305 --> 10:32.705
Tell me.

10:32.785 --> 10:35.385
Other than the map, what else do you want?

10:37.825 --> 10:40.745
I only wish to serve you

10:40.825 --> 10:43.705
and help you claim the throne.

10:44.505 --> 10:45.705
Let's celebrate in advance.

10:45.785 --> 10:48.425
May Great Qi have peaceful weather

10:48.505 --> 10:50.465
and thriving people.

10:53.225 --> 10:54.385
Xiao Huan…

10:57.705 --> 10:59.625
He jumped from Phoenix Terrace.

10:59.705 --> 11:00.665
He might…

11:00.745 --> 11:02.425
-He might be…
-I don't believe it.

11:03.905 --> 11:05.945
I don't believe a single word you say

11:06.585 --> 11:07.665
unless I see it myself.

11:07.745 --> 11:09.585
Cangcang.

11:25.265 --> 11:26.425
Ying,

11:27.785 --> 11:29.025
do you remember

11:29.625 --> 11:31.225
we used to play

11:31.305 --> 11:33.665
at Wuying Hall back then?

11:35.545 --> 11:36.625
Thank you, Huan.

11:36.705 --> 11:38.025
You said the mandarins were bitter

11:39.105 --> 11:41.625
and refused to eat them
unless we removed the pith.

11:43.945 --> 11:46.265
But you didn't like the ones I peeled.

11:47.025 --> 11:48.185
You said they were ugly.

11:48.785 --> 11:50.345
You would only eat
the ones Xiao Huan peeled.

11:53.465 --> 11:55.105
I was upset

11:56.985 --> 12:00.385
-so I peeled a lot for you.
-Tasty. I want more.

12:01.425 --> 12:02.985
Peel one more.

12:04.985 --> 12:06.745
If you like it, I can peel more.

12:11.985 --> 12:13.025
Here.

12:13.625 --> 12:15.065
No. Ugly.

12:19.385 --> 12:21.425
Ying, you must finish the mandarins

12:21.505 --> 12:22.425
I peeled for you.

12:22.505 --> 12:25.265
If not, I'll tell our mother
that you're playing favorites.

12:25.345 --> 12:27.465
Your mandarins are ugly.
I don't want them.

12:27.545 --> 12:29.225
Eat.

12:29.305 --> 12:31.425
-If you don't finish them…
-No. Your mandarins are ugly.

12:33.305 --> 12:34.185
Eat.

12:35.305 --> 12:36.545
You have to finish them.

12:38.505 --> 12:39.425
Ying.

12:39.505 --> 12:40.985
Huan.

12:41.985 --> 12:45.025
Help, Huan.

12:47.585 --> 12:48.585
Ying!

12:49.545 --> 12:50.505
Ying!

12:52.265 --> 12:53.305
Ying!

13:05.345 --> 13:06.345
You're bad!

13:06.425 --> 13:07.625
Ying.

13:07.705 --> 13:10.145
You're bad! I don't want them. Go away!

13:10.225 --> 13:11.625
-Ying.
-You're bad!

13:11.705 --> 13:13.425
-Ying.
-You're bad!

13:13.505 --> 13:14.705
You're bad!

13:14.785 --> 13:16.225
Don't be afraid, Ying.

13:16.305 --> 13:17.465
I'm here.

13:17.545 --> 13:18.785
Don't be afraid, Ying.

13:25.505 --> 13:26.585
Huan.

13:28.225 --> 13:29.585
What exactly happened

13:29.665 --> 13:30.905
during the fire at Luling Palace that day?

13:31.865 --> 13:33.025
What do you think happened?

13:34.745 --> 13:35.745
Why did you abandon Ying?

13:36.705 --> 13:38.385
You knew how she loved you, respected you.

13:38.465 --> 13:39.825
Why didn't you save her?

13:46.145 --> 13:48.705
You and I
were born into the imperial family.

13:49.385 --> 13:50.385
Yes.

13:50.905 --> 13:52.905
We were born into the imperial family.

13:54.345 --> 13:55.585
Is this

13:56.385 --> 13:57.505
the ending you all wanted?

14:00.705 --> 14:02.985
What did Du Tingxin do to you?

14:05.625 --> 14:06.865
Xiao Huan.

14:10.105 --> 14:13.345
Why did you choose to
jump from Phoenix Terrace?

14:14.865 --> 14:17.665
You haven't even told me the truth.

14:22.465 --> 14:24.465
What should I do now?

14:28.505 --> 14:31.105
VIRTUE HELD WITHIN

14:31.185 --> 14:32.065
Your Highness,

14:32.145 --> 14:33.425
the Imperial Preceptor ordered
me to bring the Princess of Ding'an back.

15:20.785 --> 15:22.065
Where's Cangcang?

15:24.545 --> 15:26.065
Even like this,

15:26.665 --> 15:29.905
-all you care about…
-Tell me where Ling Cangcang is!

15:37.665 --> 15:38.705
She's fine.

15:39.305 --> 15:40.985
She's the Empress of Great Qi.

15:42.105 --> 15:43.265
Of course, she's in Linghe Hall.

16:14.385 --> 16:15.305
Your Majesty,

16:15.825 --> 16:16.705
it's been a long while.

16:19.065 --> 16:20.905
It feels like a lifetime.

16:21.585 --> 16:23.585
Preceptor Du, you went to all this trouble

16:23.665 --> 16:25.065
to bring me back to Linghe Hall.

16:25.825 --> 16:27.145
Surely it's not for a casual chat.

16:28.585 --> 16:30.185
You're the Empress.

16:30.265 --> 16:31.905
Naturally, you should be in Linghe Hall.

16:32.825 --> 16:34.745
I'm only doing my
duty as Imperial Preceptor

16:35.385 --> 16:37.345
to escort Your Majesty back to the palace.

16:39.585 --> 16:41.505
-You want to kill me?
-Of course.

16:46.585 --> 16:49.665
I can't wait to cut you into pieces.

16:50.385 --> 16:51.465
If not for you,

16:51.545 --> 16:54.385
Xiao Huan wouldn't
have ended up like this.

16:55.065 --> 16:58.825
His condition today is all thanks to you.

17:03.065 --> 17:05.585
Your fate is said to curse His Majesty.

17:06.105 --> 17:07.745
As long as you're near him,

17:07.825 --> 17:09.825
he will never meet a good end.

17:09.905 --> 17:11.385
He's not dead.

17:12.944 --> 17:13.905
He can't be dead.

17:13.985 --> 17:16.184
I saw him jump from
Phoenix Terrace with my own eyes.

17:16.785 --> 17:17.985
Even if you lie to yourself,

17:18.585 --> 17:20.944
I'm telling you, he will not survive.

17:24.145 --> 17:25.424
For you,

17:25.505 --> 17:27.224
Xiao Huan gave up
the only medicine that could save him.

17:27.305 --> 17:28.665
What were you doing?

17:29.425 --> 17:30.625
For you,

17:30.705 --> 17:32.705
he risked his life to travel
alone to Xijiang for peace negotiations.

17:32.785 --> 17:34.025
What were you doing?

17:34.665 --> 17:35.985
Ling Cangcang,

17:36.585 --> 17:38.145
he gave you everything he could.

17:38.865 --> 17:40.345
Now that he's already
jumped from Phoenix Terrace.

17:40.425 --> 17:41.465
Why are you still alive?

17:42.425 --> 17:43.665
Why didn't you

17:44.465 --> 17:46.905
die with him?

17:55.545 --> 17:56.665
Madam.

18:02.385 --> 18:03.225
Madam.

18:12.225 --> 18:15.505
They found this
blood-soaked robe in the Qining River.

18:43.585 --> 18:44.705
How could I…

18:46.625 --> 18:49.305
How could I possibly

18:50.425 --> 18:51.625
let you die so easily?

19:15.585 --> 19:16.785
Don't worry.

19:17.865 --> 19:19.785
I won't torment you for long.

19:20.785 --> 19:22.145
Once I've had my fun,

19:23.025 --> 19:24.705
I'll send you

19:26.265 --> 19:27.785
to your demise.

19:29.665 --> 19:30.785
Du Tingxin,

19:32.705 --> 19:34.105
if you want to kill me,

19:35.025 --> 19:36.585
do it now.

19:37.825 --> 19:38.905
Otherwise,

19:40.905 --> 19:43.305
I swear I'll make you pay.

19:45.745 --> 19:46.865
As matters stand,

19:48.585 --> 19:50.665
what price could you make me pay?

22:01.585 --> 22:04.305
It's been three days since
His Majesty fell into the river.

22:04.385 --> 22:05.985
The Capital Patrol Office
has been dispatched

22:06.065 --> 22:08.265
and searched the entire Qining River,

22:08.345 --> 22:11.065
but they've found no trace of him.

22:12.985 --> 22:14.025
Your Highness,

22:14.625 --> 22:16.265
the Qining River is dangerous.

22:16.945 --> 22:19.385
There are countless
undercurrents and whirlpools.

22:19.465 --> 22:20.905
I fear His Majesty

22:20.985 --> 22:22.665
may not survive.

22:22.745 --> 22:23.825
-Yes.
-Yes.

22:25.185 --> 22:27.305
The nation can't be
without a ruler for even a day.

22:27.905 --> 22:30.785
His Majesty has met with disaster
and left no heir.

22:30.865 --> 22:33.185
Prince of Yuzhang, you're the regent now.

22:33.785 --> 22:35.865
For the sake of the people of Great Qi,

22:35.945 --> 22:38.305
you should…

22:38.385 --> 22:39.625
How presumptuous!

22:49.865 --> 22:51.025
Minister Xing,

22:52.065 --> 22:53.585
what are you trying to say?

22:53.665 --> 22:56.745
His Majesty's condition remains unclear,

22:56.825 --> 22:58.145
and all of you

22:58.225 --> 23:02.025
are already rushing to curry favor

23:03.385 --> 23:04.745
with the Prince of Yuzhang.

23:04.825 --> 23:06.385
How shameful.

23:07.065 --> 23:10.065
If His Majesty never returns,

23:10.905 --> 23:12.145
what will become of Great Qi?

23:12.745 --> 23:13.865
What will become of the imperial court?

23:14.505 --> 23:15.705
In my opinion,

23:16.305 --> 23:17.545
at a time like this,

23:17.625 --> 23:19.225
only the Prince of Yuzhang…

23:19.305 --> 23:21.225
I'm not interested.

23:23.385 --> 23:24.265
Prince of Yuzhang.

23:25.345 --> 23:26.385
If any of you

23:27.105 --> 23:29.585
wish to fight over the throne, go ahead.

23:30.265 --> 23:32.305
I'm not stepping into this mess.

23:41.865 --> 23:43.105
His Majesty slipped

23:43.185 --> 23:44.665
and fell into
the river from Phoenix Terrace.

23:45.345 --> 23:48.025
All the ministers present
saw it with your own eyes.

23:48.865 --> 23:50.665
No one who falls into the Qining River

23:50.745 --> 23:52.785
has ever survived.

23:52.865 --> 23:56.145
Even though the Capital atrol Office
is still searching…

23:56.225 --> 23:57.105
Whether alive or dead,

23:57.705 --> 23:58.865
we must find His Majesty.

23:59.825 --> 24:01.825
Until it's confirmed,

24:01.905 --> 24:03.345
no one

24:04.185 --> 24:05.465
is to covet the throne.

24:07.985 --> 24:09.345
Minister Lin,

24:09.425 --> 24:10.865
I know you're loyal to the Emperor.

24:11.545 --> 24:13.865
I myself have known
His Majesty since childhood.

24:14.665 --> 24:16.225
All the more reason
I can't accept this either.

24:19.105 --> 24:20.905
But if His Majesty can't be found,

24:21.665 --> 24:23.545
we can't wait forever.

24:24.945 --> 24:27.345
You're right, Preceptor Du.

24:27.425 --> 24:29.105
-True.
-Yes.

24:32.745 --> 24:35.825
However, according to
the founding laws of Great Qi,

24:35.905 --> 24:38.185
if the emperor's life or
death remains unknown,

24:38.265 --> 24:39.425
only after one hundred days

24:39.945 --> 24:43.705
with no word
may the throne pass to another.

24:43.785 --> 24:45.065
One hundred days?

24:46.025 --> 24:48.185
If any of you doubt it,

24:48.265 --> 24:49.545
you may consult the law

24:50.145 --> 24:53.145
and see whether I lie.

24:53.225 --> 24:54.265
Uh…

24:58.865 --> 25:01.185
Minister Lin has served two reigns

25:01.265 --> 25:04.225
and even helped
the late Emperor revise the code.

25:04.825 --> 25:05.825
He's never mistaken.

25:06.905 --> 25:09.665
However, during these one hundred days…

25:11.185 --> 25:12.305
We must ask the Prince of Yuzhang

25:12.905 --> 25:16.265
to act as Regent during this period.

25:16.345 --> 25:19.145
When His Majesty returns,
all will naturally return

25:19.745 --> 25:20.665
to its rightful order.

25:22.185 --> 25:23.305
Yes.

25:24.105 --> 25:25.865
That makes sense.

25:33.745 --> 25:35.065
Please stay, Prince of Yuzhang.

25:41.985 --> 25:44.465
His Majesty jumped from Phoenix Terrace,
and we don't know if he's alive.

25:45.425 --> 25:46.945
You don't seem to care.

25:48.985 --> 25:50.665
Why should I care about

25:50.745 --> 25:52.585
the murderer
who killed my mother and Ying?

25:53.825 --> 25:57.185
Do you have no interest in the throne?

25:59.705 --> 26:01.145
Since when have I ever cared for it?

26:02.265 --> 26:05.585
I only wanted the throne

26:06.185 --> 26:09.145
because Xiao Huan
valued it more than his own life.

26:10.585 --> 26:12.105
If he dies,

26:13.065 --> 26:15.545
what use is the throne to me?

26:18.065 --> 26:20.025
Right now I have only one thought.

26:20.625 --> 26:23.385
I hope he doesn't die in the Qining River.

26:23.465 --> 26:26.505
I want to take his life with my own hands.

26:27.945 --> 26:29.625
Then you should think about

26:30.505 --> 26:32.065
how to find His Majesty first.

26:33.985 --> 26:35.305
By the way,

26:35.385 --> 26:36.905
the Empress weeps day and night.

26:36.985 --> 26:38.705
She says she wants
to die with His Majesty.

26:39.305 --> 26:41.185
Your Highness,

26:41.265 --> 26:42.705
what do you think we should do with her?

26:45.105 --> 26:46.225
What do the rites say?

26:46.745 --> 26:49.065
If there is no news
from His Majesty after a hundred days,

26:49.145 --> 26:51.705
the Empress must be buried with him.

26:52.305 --> 26:53.305
We'll follow this rite then.

26:56.105 --> 26:57.025
I shall obey.

26:59.985 --> 27:01.025
Your Highness,

27:01.545 --> 27:06.265
when the decree announcing
the emperor's passing is issued,

27:06.345 --> 27:08.945
please deliver the decree

27:09.025 --> 27:10.305
for the Empress to be buried with him.

27:11.825 --> 27:13.785
I will.

27:16.545 --> 27:17.905
It was Xiao Huan.

27:18.505 --> 27:19.945
He fooled me.

27:20.905 --> 27:22.145
Now it's clear

27:22.905 --> 27:25.545
that he was the one who killed Ying.

27:25.625 --> 27:28.265
He would rather choose death
than admit it.

27:28.945 --> 27:30.545
So he can't blame me

27:31.105 --> 27:33.705
for destroying everything he cares about.

27:46.665 --> 27:47.505
Your Highness.

27:50.385 --> 27:52.185
Investigate all contact

27:52.265 --> 27:54.985
between Nanrong Palace and
Xuanguang Hall before the incident.

27:55.065 --> 27:56.345
Do it quietly.

27:56.425 --> 27:58.545
Don't let anyone in the palace find out.

27:58.625 --> 27:59.785
Yes, Your Highness.

28:07.585 --> 28:11.585
PROSPERITY IN FULL VIGOR

28:59.345 --> 29:00.505
Your Highness.

29:08.425 --> 29:13.385
LINGHE HALL

29:18.665 --> 29:19.825
Your Highness.

29:21.065 --> 29:21.985
The Imperial Preceptor said

29:22.665 --> 29:24.545
Her Majesty is grieving too deeply

29:24.625 --> 29:25.865
and shouldn't be disturbed.

29:25.945 --> 29:27.745
But she must repay me

29:28.265 --> 29:30.625
what she owes me.

30:12.065 --> 30:15.425
Now you finally understand my pain.

30:28.385 --> 30:29.545
Give it back to me.

30:33.825 --> 30:35.025
The pain of having your heart ripped out.

30:35.785 --> 30:37.145
The pain of a thousand
arrows through the chest.

30:39.865 --> 30:41.465
I want you

30:41.985 --> 30:43.345
to feel it just as I have.

30:47.705 --> 30:49.465
Soon,

30:49.545 --> 30:51.425
the news of His Majesty's passing

30:51.505 --> 30:52.665
will be announced.

30:53.945 --> 30:55.025
You're the Empress.

30:55.785 --> 30:57.025
You will be buried with him.

30:58.625 --> 31:00.025
But before that,

31:01.185 --> 31:04.505
I want you to eat well and stay alive.

31:05.705 --> 31:08.705
I want you to live in torment

31:09.465 --> 31:11.065
for every single moment.

31:57.705 --> 31:59.225
You know you're going to die,

31:59.745 --> 32:01.065
yet you don't even flinch.

32:03.265 --> 32:05.625
Truly a lovely couple
who would die for each other.

32:10.945 --> 32:13.185
He said he wanted to die with dignity.

32:14.825 --> 32:15.945
Then he turned around

32:16.465 --> 32:17.985
and jumped off Phoenix Terrace.

32:22.505 --> 32:24.785
He just wanted to be
thought dead and gone!

32:27.665 --> 32:29.145
How I wish

32:29.225 --> 32:30.825
I could run a sword
through his heart myself.

32:42.985 --> 32:44.185
Your Highness.

33:23.625 --> 33:25.025
He said he chose death,

33:25.825 --> 33:27.545
but jumped from Phoenix Terrace

33:29.385 --> 33:30.505
and disappeared.

33:30.585 --> 33:31.665
That means

33:34.145 --> 33:35.545
there's still hope.

33:50.185 --> 33:51.305
If he only disappeared,

33:52.265 --> 33:54.065
then there's still hope.

33:58.025 --> 34:02.985
THE START OF A BRIGHT FUTURE

34:29.744 --> 34:31.304
I passed by

34:31.385 --> 34:33.185
your favorite dessert shop today.

34:33.905 --> 34:35.385
I bought a few bowls

34:36.105 --> 34:38.225
of your favorites.

35:07.785 --> 35:08.785
Eat.

35:10.585 --> 35:12.945
Do you know why I like that shop?

35:15.145 --> 35:16.305
No.

35:17.905 --> 35:19.745
Because they use more sugar.

35:20.905 --> 35:21.905
When it's sweet,

35:23.745 --> 35:25.545
life doesn't feel so bitter.

35:55.105 --> 35:56.945
But now it feels too sweet.

35:57.825 --> 35:59.425
It doesn't taste good.

36:05.465 --> 36:06.745
Fine.

36:06.825 --> 36:08.105
Tomorrow I'll buy from another shop…

36:08.185 --> 36:09.985
Do you find this fun?

36:12.625 --> 36:13.745
How many days can you keep me here?

36:17.065 --> 36:18.545
I do find it fun.

36:19.865 --> 36:21.625
I think you're doing well here.

36:23.105 --> 36:24.665
Are you really that eager to leave me?

36:26.985 --> 36:28.665
Xiao Qianqing,

36:28.745 --> 36:30.385
I have to go.

36:32.265 --> 36:33.385
I need to save Cangcang.

37:04.465 --> 37:05.625
What did you say?

37:06.545 --> 37:08.105
She's started eating again?

37:08.185 --> 37:09.345
Yes, Madam.

37:10.065 --> 37:12.585
Her Majesty has found her will to live.

37:19.145 --> 37:22.945
I thought your love for Xiao Huan
was so deep

37:23.905 --> 37:26.665
that you'd cry day and night
and suffer endlessly.

37:33.745 --> 37:35.105
Since that's the case,

37:35.745 --> 37:37.225
I won't let you live

37:38.665 --> 37:40.625
a day longer.

37:55.945 --> 37:57.505
Your Majesty, be on your way, please.

37:59.505 --> 38:00.665
What?

38:01.745 --> 38:03.825
Du Tingxin can't wait

38:03.905 --> 38:05.185
for the Empress of Great Qi to be buried?

38:06.825 --> 38:08.025
Is she so afraid I'll live another day?

38:08.705 --> 38:12.185
Please do it yourself, Your Majesty.

38:12.265 --> 38:13.905
If I do it,

38:14.505 --> 38:16.785
it'll be painful.

38:16.865 --> 38:19.985
How could I give you what you want?

38:20.665 --> 38:22.025
Forgive me then.

38:48.745 --> 38:50.025
Zhong Lin?

38:55.825 --> 38:56.865
Let's go.

38:57.625 --> 38:58.705
Careful.

39:34.145 --> 39:35.025
Madam,

39:35.105 --> 39:37.225
Her Majesty has escaped.

39:38.505 --> 39:41.745
I didn't know
Her Majesty still had influence

39:41.825 --> 39:43.145
inside the palace.

39:46.585 --> 39:47.945
I truly

39:49.385 --> 39:51.185
underestimated her.

39:51.945 --> 39:56.705
FAYUN TEMPLE

40:04.945 --> 40:05.985
Father.

40:30.465 --> 40:31.465
Father.

40:34.265 --> 40:35.345
I'm here.

40:42.305 --> 40:43.905
Great that you're safe.

41:06.665 --> 41:07.705
Father.

41:10.105 --> 41:12.065
About what Du Tingxin has done,

41:13.305 --> 41:15.185
were you involved?

41:16.505 --> 41:17.905
Is it nippy outside?

41:20.305 --> 41:21.545
Your hands are cold.

41:21.625 --> 41:22.465
You're a grown-up

41:22.545 --> 41:24.065
and still don't know
how to take care of yourself.

41:24.865 --> 41:26.425
Here. Take this.

41:27.745 --> 41:28.905
Take this.

41:29.585 --> 41:31.345
Do you know about the death

41:33.225 --> 41:34.105
of the Empress Dowager Liu
and Princess Ying?

41:36.705 --> 41:37.825
Cangcang,

41:38.345 --> 41:40.385
you came here

41:40.905 --> 41:42.305
just to ask about this?

41:43.465 --> 41:44.465
Stop hiding it, Father.

41:45.425 --> 41:47.145
Xiao Huan has disappeared now.

41:47.665 --> 41:50.425
The Prince of
Yuzhang has turned against him

41:50.505 --> 41:53.065
and joined Du Tingxin in the coup.

41:53.585 --> 41:57.345
-I need to know the truth.
-Cangcang, stop digging.

41:57.425 --> 41:59.545
What matters most
now is that you head north

41:59.625 --> 42:00.945
and meet Jueding.

42:01.025 --> 42:03.745
The Northern Garrison Army
can protect you, understand?

42:03.825 --> 42:05.185
You want me

42:06.145 --> 42:07.145
to leave the Capital

42:08.705 --> 42:10.025
and go to the northern border?

42:13.265 --> 42:16.225
What about Xiao Huan? What about Great Qi?

42:16.305 --> 42:18.505
Cangcang, even if you find out the truth,

42:18.585 --> 42:19.905
what difference does it make?

42:19.985 --> 42:21.145
It does make a difference.

42:22.105 --> 42:23.145
Father,

42:23.225 --> 42:26.785
if Xiao Huan has only
disappeared, it means there's still hope.

42:26.865 --> 42:28.105
I believe

42:28.185 --> 42:29.985
he'll come back alive.

42:30.585 --> 42:32.345
That's why the truth matters.

42:33.065 --> 42:34.305
Father,

42:34.385 --> 42:35.665
please tell me.

42:36.905 --> 42:38.025
Cangcang,

42:39.105 --> 42:40.425
you're so stubborn.

42:41.905 --> 42:45.065
You wouldn't listen to
a single word I said.

42:49.385 --> 42:50.705
Do you know

42:51.745 --> 42:53.985
what you're about to face?

42:55.145 --> 42:57.185
Du Tingxin.

42:57.265 --> 42:59.265
She's a mad dog.
